Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">Resistance</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/29px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/39px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">Cold</span></a> damage.</li></ul>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Agathys\" title=\"Armour of Agathys\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp/40px-Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp/60px-Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp/80px-Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour of Agathys\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp/40px-Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/77/Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Agathys\" title=\"Armour of Agathys\">Armour of Agathys</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Cast as a level 3 spell (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Reithwin_Graveyard\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reithwin Graveyard\">Reithwin Graveyard</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-158&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;73</span>: Inside a sarcophagus north of the iron gate</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>If the robe is removed while its version of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Agathys\" title=\"Armour of Agathys\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp/25px-Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp/38px-Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp/50px-Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour of Agathys\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp/25px-Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/77/Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Agathys\" title=\"Armour of Agathys\">Armour of Agathys</a> is active, the spell ends.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 535.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 533.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau-firerobe-1.jpeg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Concept art by Châu Nguyễn Thị Hoài.\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau-firerobe-1.jpeg/800px-Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau-firerobe-1.jpeg.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau-firerobe-1.jpeg/1200px-Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau-firerobe-1.jpeg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau-firerobe-1.jpeg/1600px-Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau-firerobe-1.jpeg.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Concept art by Châu Nguyễn Thị Hoài.\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau-firerobe-1.jpeg/800px-Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau-firerobe-1.jpeg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"534\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/70/Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau